            "review_text": "Ravin Zhong\n31 contributions\n0\nOne of the best if not t the best\nSep 2018 • Friends\nMy first visit there upon recommendation by a friend turned up a cosy little joint tucked away among shops adjacent to cuch gach quan. Wasn't sure where was it because we went at night. Even the Grabcar had problems finding the location. As per the usual vegetarian restaurant the environment and ambiance was clean and refreshing. Staff were very helpful and attentive to recommend dishes according to your tastebuds. \n\nFood was fast to arrive and as we ordered too much they were fast to take away for us too. Based on the ambiance alone i give it a 5 star. Food is decent but as with vegetarian fare can be a bit bland.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2019",
